- Okay, that's it.

00:00:01.830 --> 00:00:03.810
I am not covering any more Trump news.

00:00:03.810 --> 00:00:06.390
No more Trump legal issues. I'm done.

00:00:06.390 --> 00:00:07.223
Nope.

00:00:07.223 --> 00:00:08.700
Even though this lawsuit
has the potential to destroy

00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:11.373
the entire Trump organization,
I'm not gonna do it,

00:00:12.660 --> 00:00:14.010
but I know someone who can.

00:00:15.390 --> 00:00:17.078
Get me Spencer the scowl owl.

00:00:17.078 --> 00:00:18.120
