00:00:18.120 --> 00:00:19.500
- Devon I just wanna say thank you

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:21.150
for letting me talk about a subject,

00:00:21.150 --> 00:00:23.520
not a single soul is
tired of hearing about,

00:00:23.520 --> 00:00:26.130
and that is Donald Trump's legal problems.

00:00:26.130 --> 00:00:28.350
Now of course, asking
a criminal prosecutor

00:00:28.350 --> 00:00:30.323
to talk about civil law

00:00:30.323 --> 00:00:33.780
is a bit like asking a baseball
player to opine about golf.

00:00:33.780 --> 00:00:35.430
After all, we both use sticks

00:00:35.430 --> 00:00:37.560
to hit balls a certain distance depending

00:00:37.560 --> 00:00:39.090
